      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A reset isn't working and Write Defaults changed nothing for me. I'm also apparently not the only one experiencing this issue. I have gotten gestures working the exact way I'm doing them on SDKs up until this latest version. It's also worth noting that I'm not doing anything unusual with layers, at all. Even a fresh Unity project with nothing but the SDK and FBX, combined with the edited (IE adding a smile or sad face) anim and anim controllers does not work.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
