      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm having this exact same issue. I even tried messing with masks and write defaults, setting the masks on all layers for the fx layer to muscles only and setting the write defaults to off on everything. The issue still persists. It's very frustrating for me. I've even tried using animations that reset the states of my facial expressions and such and even that wasn't working because it would do things like fix the animations in the action menu, but prevent the use of animations on the hands.",
